  "summary": "Malicious code in dolyame-boxy-atom-bnpl-info-card (npm)",
  "details": "On require(), the package runs a loader that fingerprints the platform/arch and downloads a second-stage binary from Cloudflare Workers endpoints (oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf102-baf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf99-9b3[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev) at paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, /pkg/package.exe, with a DNS-TXT fallback channel via c[.]sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The downloaded payload is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe on Windows), made executable, and launched as a detached background process so it persists after the parent exits. A marker file /tmp/.analytics_state throttles repeat downloads.",
